    "problem": "Let $\\mathbf{a}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$, $\\mathbf{b}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}$ and $\\mathbf{c}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$. Find $\\mathbf{a}-(2\\mathbf{b}+5\\mathbf{c})$.",
